join Naledi (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Naledi (Aggravated)
Naledi: This village runs on people who are already tired.
- Including you
	Hope: Including you.
	Naledi: There are four stalls that need moving before the fair and one of them belongs to a man who won't move it.
	Naledi: So. Yes. Including me.
- I'm not sure I'm any use here
	Hope: I'm not sure I'm any use here.
	Naledi: That is a thing people say in their second year. Not the first — the first year you are too busy to wonder.
	Naledi: I am not going to tell you that you are. You would not believe me and you would be right not to.
	Naledi: Ask me again after the rains.
set {GameState.hope_doubts_raised} = true
